# Tint plates for the sunglasses builder. The staged builder plates (gen-*.png, ~57MB) DO
# ship — they are what the live customiser renders. Everything else here (the large
# hand-retouched "yours" source set, scratch exports) stays out of the bundle.
frontend/public/tint-proto/*
!frontend/public/tint-proto/gen-*.png
!frontend/public/tint-proto/thumb-*.png

# Full-resolution frame plates pulled from the database for the tint pipeline (reproducible)
scripts/hires-plates/
scripts/latest-plates/
